#: data/maps/RustboroCity_CuttersHouse/scripts.inc:24
msgctxt "RustboroCity_CuttersHouse_Text_YouCanPutThisHMToGoodUse"
msgid ""
"That determined expression…\n"
"That limber way you move…\l"
"And your well-trained POKéMON…\p"
"You're obviously a skilled TRAINER!\p"
"No, wait, don't say a word.\n"
"I can tell just by looking at you.\p"
"I'm sure that you can put this\n"
"HIDDEN MACHINE to good use.\p"
"No need to be modest or shy.\n"
"Go on, take it!$"
msgstr ""
"那坚定的表情……\n"
"那灵活的动作……\l"
"还有那训练有素的宝可梦……\p"
"你一看就是个厉害的训练家！\p"
"不，等一下，什么都别说。\n"
"我光看你就知道了。\p"
"我相信你一定能好好\n"
"利用这个秘传学习器。\p"
"不用客气，也不用害羞。\n"
"来，收下吧！$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_CuttersHouse/scripts.inc:36
msgctxt "RustboroCity_CuttersHouse_Text_ExplainCut"
msgid ""
"That HIDDEN MACHINE, or HM for\n"
"short, is CUT.\p"
"An HM move is one that can be used\n"
"by POKéMON outside of battle.\p"
"Any POKéMON that's learned CUT can\n"
"chop down thin trees if the TRAINER\l"
"has earned the STONE BADGE.\p"
"And, unlike a TM, an HM can be used\n"
"more than once.$"
msgstr ""
"这个秘传学习器里\n"
"是居合斩。\p"
"秘传招式是宝可梦在\n"
"对战以外也能使用的招式。\p"
"只要训练家拿到了原石徽章，\n"
"学会居合斩的宝可梦\l"
"就能砍断细小的树木。\p"
"而且，和招式学习器不同，\n"
"秘传学习器可以使用很多次。$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_CuttersHouse/scripts.inc:47
msgctxt "RustboroCity_CuttersHouse_Text_DadHelpedClearLandOfTrees"
msgid ""
"When they were expanding the city of\n"
"RUSTBORO, my dad helped out.\p"
"He made his POKéMON use CUT to clear\n"
"the land of trees.$"
msgstr ""
"卡那兹市扩建的时候，\n"
"我爸爸也帮了忙。\p"
"他让他的宝可梦使用居合斩，\n"
"把那里的树都砍掉了。$"
